OL,3,GNEWSALong forgotten tramway unearthed
OL,4,Aafter 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of a historic tramway, which
OL,7,Fhas lain buried for nearly 150 years,
OL,8,Fhas been unearthed.
OL,10,FThe track is believed to be part of a
OL,11,Fline between Castle Cary and Somerton
OL,12,Fin Somerset which was commissioned in
OL,13,Fthe 1880s to transport stone away from
OL,14,Flocal quarries but was never completed.
OL,16,FThe short section was discovered
OL,17,Foutside the Cross Keys pub near East
OL,18,FLydford during recent roadworks on the
OL,19,FB3153.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
