OL,3,GNEWSALong forgotten tramway unearthed
OL,4,Aafter 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchivists from the National Railway
OL,7,FMuseum (NRM) in York have confirmed
OL,8,Fthat the rail could be a type of rack
OL,9,Frail, most commonly used for steep
OL,10,Fgradients.
